Package: globalmacrocockpit
Title: Global Macro Cockpit
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Martin Hoshi", "Vognsen", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A registry-driven, leading-indicator-first macro dashboard: a local
    Shiny app plus a static public build for GitHub Pages. This is not an R package;
    the file lists the dependencies used by the app and by the automated build.
